{"seq":3,"slug":"spatial-3d-audio","title":"空间音频与 3D 定位","url":"/l-doc-books/h/game-development/game-audio/sound-design/spatial-3d-audio","wordCount":1537,"readingTime":7,"html":"<h1 id=\"空间音频与-3d-定位\">空间音频与 3D 定位</h1><p>在《CS2》或《无畏契约》里，凭脚步声判断敌人在你左后方还是右前方、在上层还是同层，往往决定一场对枪的胜负。这种&quot;用耳朵看见空间&quot;的能力，靠的是一整套把单声道干声放进三维世界、再渲染成双耳信号的技术。本篇讲游戏里的空间音频：从基础的距离衰减与声像，到遮挡阻隔，再到 HRTF 与对象化空间音频。它处理的正是<a href=\"../foundations/role-and-types\">游戏声音的角色与类型</a>里&quot;叙事内声音必须遵守世界物理&quot;这条约束的技术实现，所用的干声则来自<a href=\"foley-assets\">拟音与声音素材</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>空间音频的任务是回答：&quot;一个位于世界某点的声源，在玩家（听者）的双耳里应该是什么样？&quot;这要综合距离、方向、遮挡、环境四个因素，逐级处理。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;  A[声源世界坐标 + 干声] --&gt; B[距离衰减&lt;br/&gt;音量随距离下降]&#10;  B --&gt; C[方向定位&lt;br/&gt;声像 + 多普勒]&#10;  C --&gt; D[遮挡处理&lt;br/&gt;occlusion / obstruction]&#10;  D --&gt; E[环境/混响&lt;br/&gt;房间声学]&#10;  E --&gt; F[空间渲染&lt;br/&gt;声道 or HRTF/对象]&#10;  F --&gt; G[双耳/多声道输出]\">graph TD\n  A[声源世界坐标 + 干声] --&gt; B[距离衰减&lt;br/&gt;音量随距离下降]\n  B --&gt; C[方向定位&lt;br/&gt;声像 + 多普勒]\n  C --&gt; D[遮挡处理&lt;br/&gt;occlusion / obstruction]\n  D --&gt; E[环境/混响&lt;br/&gt;房间声学]\n  E --&gt; F[空间渲染&lt;br/&gt;声道 or HRTF/对象]\n  F --&gt; G[双耳/多声道输出]</pre><p>理解这条链路的关键是：每一级都在干声上叠加一种&quot;空间线索&quot;，玩家的大脑把这些线索综合还原出声源的三维位置。线索越准、越一致，定位感越强。</p>\n<h2 id=\"距离与方向-最基础的两个线索\">距离与方向：最基础的两个线索</h2><p><strong>距离衰减</strong>模拟声音随传播变弱。物理上点声源遵循平方反比律，声压随距离 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>r</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">r</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span></span></span></span></span> 的变化为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>L</mi><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>L</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><mo>−</mo><mn>20</mn><msub><mrow><mi>log</mi><mo>⁡</mo></mrow><mn>10</mn></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>r</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><msub><mi>r</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">L = L_0 - 20\\log_{10}(r/r_0)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">0</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">20</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\"><span class=\"mop\">lo<span style=\"margin-right:0.0139em;\">g</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.207em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.4559em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">10</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2441em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mord\">/</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0278em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">0</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>，即距离翻倍约衰减 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>6</mn><mtext> </mtext><mtext>dB</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">6\\,\\text{dB}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">6</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">dB</span></span></span></span></span></span>。但游戏几乎从不用纯物理曲线——太陡的衰减会让稍远的声音瞬间消失。中间件提供可手绘的衰减曲线，设计师在&quot;可听范围&quot;和&quot;真实感&quot;之间折中，这正是<a href=\"../foundations/interactive-audio-mindset\">交互式音频思维</a>里参数曲线思想的直接应用。</p>\n<p><strong>方向定位</strong>靠两个双耳线索：到达两耳的时间差（ITD）和强度差（ILD）。最简单的实现是按声源相对听者的角度做立体声声像（panning）。运动的声源还会产生<strong>多普勒效应</strong>——靠近时音高升高、远离时降低，呼啸而过的子弹和赛车全靠它。设声速 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>c</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">c</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span></span></span></span></span>、声源径向速度 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>v</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">v</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">v</span></span></span></span></span>，观察到的频率 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi>f</mi><mo mathvariant=\"normal\" lspace=\"0em\" rspace=\"0em\">′</mo></msup><mo>=</mo><mi>f</mi><mo>⋅</mo><mfrac><mi>c</mi><mrow><mi>c</mi><mo>−</mo><mi>v</mi></mrow></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">f&#x27; = f \\cdot \\frac{c}{c - v}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9463em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.7519em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">′</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0987em;vertical-align:-0.4033em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.6954em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.655em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">c</span><span class=\"mbin mtight\">−</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">v</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.394em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">c</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.4033em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"遮挡与阻隔-让墙起作用\">遮挡与阻隔：让墙起作用</h2><p>竞技游戏的公平性高度依赖玩家能否&quot;听墙&quot;。当声源与听者之间有障碍物时，需要区分两种处理，下表说明：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>现象</th>\n<th>含义</th>\n<th>听感处理</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>遮挡 occlusion</td>\n<td>直达声与反射声都被完全挡住（隔着实墙）</td>\n<td>整体大幅衰减 + 强低通（声音变闷变小）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>阻隔 obstruction</td>\n<td>直达声被挡但反射声仍能绕过（隔着矮墙/拐角）</td>\n<td>直达声变闷，但混响/环境仍在</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>实现上需要从声源向听者投射射线检测障碍，再据材质决定衰减量和低通截止频率——金属门和布帘的遮挡量天差地别。这类计算成本不低，是<a href=\"../implementation/performance-memory\">性能与内存优化</a>要权衡的开销之一。Wwise 等中间件内建了声音传播、遮挡与阻隔的处理管线（来源：<a href=\"https://toxigon.com/audio-middleware-comparison-fmod-vs-wwise\">Toxigon, FMOD vs Wwise</a>）。</p>\n<p>空间音频的典型工程失误集中在几处，下表把现象对应到成因，便于排查：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>现象</th>\n<th>常见成因</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>上下方位听不出来</td>\n<td>未启用 HRTF，只做了水平声像</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>声音穿透墙壁直响</td>\n<td>未做遮挡检测，或射线层配置遗漏</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>自己的脚步忽左忽右</td>\n<td>听者朝向与相机朝向不同步</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>远处声音突然冒出</td>\n<td>衰减曲线过陡或最小距离设置不当</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>混响在整个关卡一成不变</td>\n<td>未做区域/房间环境切换，只用全局混响</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"hrtf-与对象化空间音频\">HRTF 与对象化空间音频</h2><p>前面的声像只能在水平面左右定位，无法表达&quot;上方/下方/正后方&quot;。要做到全方位的双耳定位，需要 <strong>HRTF</strong>（Head-Related Transfer Function，头部相关传输函数）——它是一组滤波器，建模声波在到达鼓膜前与头部、耳廓、肩膀交互产生的频谱染色。用 HRTF 卷积干声，戴耳机的玩家就能感知到声源的完整三维方位。《CS2》采用 Steam Audio 并提供 HRTF 开关，《无畏契约》也内建 HRTF（来源：<a href=\"https://gamerhardware.org/spatial-audio-gaming/\">Gamer Hardware, Spatial Audio for Gaming 2026</a>）。</p>\n<p>更进一步是<strong>对象化空间音频</strong>（object-based audio）。传统声道化音频把声音预先混进固定的 7.1 声道；对象化则把每个声音作为带三维坐标的&quot;对象&quot;传给渲染器，由播放端的实际扬声器布局或耳机实时计算位置。Dolby Atmos 和 DTS:X 走的就是这条路，它带来基于高度声道的更强沉浸（来源：<a href=\"https://gamerhardware.org/windows-sonic-vs-dolby-atmos-dts/\">Gamer Hardware, Windows Sonic vs Dolby Atmos vs DTS 2026</a>）。Windows Sonic 则是系统自带、零延迟惩罚的免费虚拟环绕方案，适合作为保底。</p>\n<p>需要权衡的是：HRTF 与对象化渲染显著提升沉浸与定位，但每条声音的卷积有 CPU 成本，因此通常只对少量重要的近距声源启用全质量空间化，远处与不重要的声源降级处理。判断哪些声源值得上全质量，可以参考三条准则：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>信息价值高</strong>：能改变玩家决策的声音（近处敌人脚步、方位性枪声）优先。</li>\n<li><strong>距离近</strong>：越近越值得，远处的声源本就该被衰减掩盖。</li>\n<li><strong>数量可控</strong>：同一时刻上全质量的声源保持个位数，超出部分退回普通声像。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>空间音频逐级在干声上叠加距离、方向、遮挡、环境四类线索，让玩家大脑还原声源三维位置。</li>\n<li>距离衰减用可手绘曲线而非纯物理平方反比；方向靠 ITD/ILD 声像，运动声源加多普勒。</li>\n<li>遮挡（实墙，整体衰减+强低通）与阻隔（拐角，直达变闷但混响仍在）要区别处理，靠射线检测+材质。</li>\n<li>HRTF 用头部滤波实现全方位双耳定位（CS2/Steam Audio、无畏契约已采用）；对象化音频（Dolby Atmos/DTS:X）把声音作为三维对象交渲染端实时定位。</li>\n<li>高质量空间化有 CPU 成本，按重要性分级启用，权衡细节见<a href=\"../implementation/performance-memory\">性能与内存优化</a>。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"空间音频与 3D 定位","id":"空间音频与-3d-定位"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"距离与方向：最基础的两个线索","id":"距离与方向-最基础的两个线索"},{"level":2,"text":"遮挡与阻隔：让墙起作用","id":"遮挡与阻隔-让墙起作用"},{"level":2,"text":"HRTF 与对象化空间音频","id":"hrtf-与对象化空间音频"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"拟音与声音素材","url":"/l-doc-books/h/game-development/game-audio/sound-design/foley-assets"},"next":{"title":"自适应音乐系统","url":"/l-doc-books/h/game-development/game-audio/adaptive-music/adaptive-systems"}}